# shadcn-svelte conventions

## Documentation sources

1. **Context7 MCP** — `get-library-docs` with `/websites/shadcn-svelte`
2. **Official docs** — https://www.shadcn-svelte.com/docs
3. **Official llms.txt** — https://www.shadcn-svelte.com/llms.txt
4. **Add components** — `npx shadcn-svelte@latest add <name> -y`

## This project

- **Config**: [components.json](components.json) — vega style, neutral base, dark mode default
- **UI path**: `$lib/components/ui/<component>/index.js`
- **Utils**: `cn()` from `$lib/utils.js`
- **Icons**: `@lucide/svelte/icons/*`
- **Theme**: Spotify-inspired green `--primary` in `.dark` ([src/routes/layout.css](src/routes/layout.css))

## Usage rules

- Prefer shadcn components (`Button`, `Card`, `Badge`, `Alert`, `Checkbox`, `Progress`, `Avatar`, `ScrollArea`) over raw styled HTML
- Import from `$lib/components/ui/.../index.js` (include `.js` extension)
- Extend shadcn source files in `src/lib/components/ui/` when needed — they are owned by the project
- Use semantic tokens: `bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, `border-border`, `text-primary` — not custom `--color-*` vars

## Adding new UI

```bash
npx shadcn-svelte@latest add dialog tabs -y
```

Run `pnpm check` after adding or editing components.
